  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this Emergency Appeal the International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies (IFRC) aims to support the TRC in the response to the Kahramamara&#x15f; Earthquake Operation. The strategy of the IFRC&#x2019;s response will be to meet the immediate and early recovery needs of approximately 300,000 people affected in Kahramanmara&#x15f; province and the surrounding provinces.</narrative>
